[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

; One variable: a `_min` that the file writes above the `_max`, and a `_min` with no `_max`.
; Godot's paired setters pull one bound onto the other (`cpu_particles_2d.cpp:352-376`), so
; `initial_velocity_min = 200` then `initial_velocity_max = 100` loads 100 and 100, and a lone
; `scale_amount_min = 6` loads 6 and 6. Every other emitter fixture authors an ordered pair, so
; none of them shows the load. Measure with `pnpm ref:godot unit-cpuparticles2d-crossed-range.tscn
; --mode 2d --particles 0`.

